WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.710
<b>皓瀚霏凡 作品
-=圣城家园 CnSCG 荣誉出品=-</b><b>
http://hd.cnscg.com</b><b></b>

00:04.710 --> 00:08.000
<b>解散监管机构并非我们的初衷</b><b>
We have no intention of dismantling the regulatory agencies.</b>

00:08.550 --> 00:12.920
<b>但实际上 我们整天被这些低效繁琐的规则所纠缠</b><b>
However, we must come to grips with inefficient and burdensome regulations.</b>

00:13.430 --> 00:16.720
<b>我们要裁撤那些毫无效益非必要的部门</b><b>
We will eliminate those that are unproductive and unnecessary.</b>

00:16.800 --> 00:21.020
<b>取消那些过时的规章制度 授予银行全新的职权</b><b>
Tearing down these antiquated walls and granting banks significant new authority.</b>

00:21.730 --> 00:23.640
<b>银行业迎来利好消息</b><b>
In a victory for the banking industry,</b>

00:23.730 --> 00:25.600
<b>国会通过了立法</b><b>
Congress has approved legislation</b>

00:25.690 --> 00:27.900
<b>准许商业银行和投资银行进行合并</b><b>
which will allow commercial and investment banks</b>

00:27.980 --> 00:32.360
<b>形成史上最大的 业务覆盖全球的金融机构</b><b>
to merge and form institutions of unprecedented size and global reach.</b>

00:32.480 --> 00:35.360
<b>片名:大而不倒</b><b></b>

00:35.610 --> 00:41.830
<b>我认为我们没有必要为了防范管制风险而去增加管制</b><b>
I think it's very important for us not to introduce regulation for regulation's sake.</b>

00:42.330 --> 00:43.910
<b>我一直坚信着美国梦</b><b>
I do believe in the American dream.</b>

00:45.460 --> 00:48.000
<b>而拥有自己的房产则是梦开始的地方</b><b>
Owning a home is a part of that dream.</b>

00:48.000 --> 00:50.000
<b>-=圣城家园SCG字幕组 http://hd.cnscg.com/=-
仅供翻译交流使用, 禁止用于商业用途</b><b></b>

00:50.000 --> 00:56.090
<b>我们正采取措施 帮助数以万计的美国人拥有自己的房产</b><b>
We are taking action to bring many thousands of Americans closer to owning a home.</b>

00:56.430 --> 00:59.890
<b>这项计划不仅有利于全体公民</b><b>
This project not only is good for the soul of the country,</b>

00:59.970 --> 01:02.010
<b>同时也能带动国家经济的发展</b><b>
it's good for the pocketbook of the country as well.</b>

01:02.680 --> 01:05.440
<b>房地产市场已经近乎疯狂</b><b>
The housing market has reached frantic proportions.</b>

01:05.520 --> 01:08.480
<b>大家似乎都在忙着盖房子 然后进行买卖</b><b>
It seems that everybody is building, buying or selling.</b>

01:08.560 --> 01:11.400
<b>道琼斯和标普指数双双创出新高</b><b>
The Dow and the S&P both breaking records.</b>

01:11.480 --> 01:15.110
<b>高盛集团今年的利润飙升93%</b><b>
Profits soared 93% at Goldman Sachs this year.</b>

01:15.950 --> 01:20.070
<b>交易员中的佼佼者和银行从业人员收入预计将达到1000万</b><b>
Hotshot traders and bankers can expect to take home 10, 25,</b>

01:20.160 --> 01:22.790
<b>2500万 甚至是5000万</b><b>
and in some cases, $50 million.</b>

01:22.870 --> 01:25.910
<b>这一切好得近乎天方夜谭了</b><b>
Things that are too good to be true, are.</b>

01:26.000 --> 01:27.830
<b>当你看到其中的...</b><b>
When you see something coming...</b>

01:27.920 --> 01:28.920
<b>房地产业的泡沫...</b><b>
The real estate bubble...</b>

01:29.000 --> 01:29.960
<b>- 房地产泡沫  - 泡沫</b><b>
- Housing bubble.  - Bubble.</b>

01:30.040 --> 01:31.750
<b>切不可视而不见</b><b>
don't put it off.</b>

01:31.840 --> 01:33.590
<b>要立即采取行动</b><b>
Take action immediately.</b>

01:33.670 --> 01:36.220
<b>泡沫会逐渐缓解 还是只能等到破灭?</b><b>
Will there be a soft landing, or will the bubble burst?</b>

01:36.670 --> 01:40.220
