<b>这是什么?</b><b>
What's this?</b>

01:33:23.590 --> 01:33:25.220
<b>那是 额</b><b>
That is, um,</b>

01:33:26.850 --> 01:33:28.680
<b>一种有毒镖蛙</b><b>
a poison dart frog.</b>

01:33:29.430 --> 01:33:32.520
<b>温迪在圭亚那照的</b><b>
Wendy took it in Guyana.</b>

01:33:45.780 --> 01:33:47.320
<b>这是你的吗?</b><b>
